### Service Status

```powershell
Get-Service Caddy
```

### Port Listening

```powershell
Get-NetTCPConnection -LocalPort 8086 -State Listen | Format-Table LocalAddress, LocalPort
```

Expected output:

```
LocalAddress   LocalPort
------------   ---------
100.69.66.60        8086
```

### Browser Test

From any Tailscale-connected device, navigate to:

```
https://100.69.66.60:8086/
```

Accept the certificate warning (expected for self-signed certificates), and the LibreHardwareMonitor dashboard should load.

